  "notes": [
   "Units are quarter units. 'Total Required: 90 Units' is read as the whole-degree total (Cal-GETC plus CSU-transferable electives 'as needed to reach at least 90 units'), so it is recorded in degree_total; the catalog prints no separate major total, so total_units is null.",
   "List B is 'Complete one course in three areas: (11 - 12 Units)': the student picks one course in each of any three of the eight areas, not one whole area. The eight area blocks share option_group 'List B areas' for that reason; a reviewer should note the rule is three of eight areas.",
   "The Cal-GETC/electives sentence is split across the page 55/56 break and printed inside the List A table; List A courses continue on page 56.",
